  "description": "DicomObjects.Net is a simple to use .NET based DICOM library. The API is user-friendly and is aimed to provide easy ways to build DICOM solution.\n            This library is actively supported by MedicalConnections Ltd, UK. If you have any questions please contact our support team.",
  "id": "DicomObjects.Core",
